        "operation": "completion",
        "respondWith": "showText",
        "responseText": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <style>\n    /* Fondo general suave (no negro puro) para reducir fatiga visual */\n    body {\n      background-color: #121212;\n      color: #e0e0e0;\n      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Tarjeta con elevación y gris ligeramente más claro */\n    .card {\n      background-color: #1e1e1e;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 320px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n      border: 1px solid #333;\n    }\n\n    img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: auto;\n      display: block;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      padding: 24px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.6rem;\n      margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n\n    .meta {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: #9e9e9e;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    /* Regla especial: Fuerza el color del texto del resumen */\n    /* El !important asegura que si el JSON trae estilos, los ignoramos */\n    .summary-text, .summary-text p {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      color: #b0b3b8 !important; \n      margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n\n    /* Botón azul moderno (Material Design style) */\n    .btn {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 12px 0;\n      background-color: #2979ff; \n      color: white;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      transition: background-color 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    .btn:hover {\n      background-color: #1565c0;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <img src=\"{{ $json.image.original }}\" alt=\"Poster\">\n    \n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1>{{ $json.name }}</h1>\n      \n      <div class=\"meta\">\n        <span>⭐ {{ $json.rating?.average ? $json.rating.average + '/10' : 'Sin puntuación' }}</span>\n        <span>📅 {{ $json.premiered }}</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"summary-text\">\n        {{ $json.summary }}\n      </div>\n      \n     <a href=\"https://fernando-francisco.app.n8n.cloud/form/d8e3e981-6139-4952-871b-6bd6c5e5f360\" class=\"btn\">Volver a buscar</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
